# CLAUDE.local.md

Local machine setup — not checked in (see .gitignore). Loaded alongside CLAUDE.md.
Do not scan filesystem other than the project folder without checking with me.

## Bench

- **Binary:** `/path/to/venv/bin/bench`
- **Bench root** (run bench commands from here): `/path/to/benches/<bench-name>`

## Expenso site

- **Site name:** `<site-name>.test`
- **URL:** `http://127.0.0.1:<port>/`
- **Login:** `administrator` / `<password>`

If the site is not reachable, ask me to start the bench.

## ERPNext site (separate, for reference only)

- **Site name:** `<erpnext-site-name>.test`
- **URL:** `http://127.0.0.1:<port>`
- **Login:** `Administrator` / `<password>`
- Default ERPNext demo data is available on this site.

## Useful commands

```bash
# Start bench (Frappe dev server + Redis + workers)
/path/to/venv/bin/bench start

# Migrate after DocType changes
/path/to/venv/bin/bench --site <site-name>.test migrate

# Clear cache after hooks.py or permission changes
/path/to/venv/bin/bench --site <site-name>.test clear-cache

# List installed apps
/path/to/venv/bin/bench --site <site-name>.test list-apps

# Frontend dev server with HMR (from apps/expenso/frontend/)
npm run dev
```
